  "bodyHash": "75facde55239fcec",
  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;color:#008000\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:36px\">聰</span><span style=\"color:#9c0;font-size:36px\">明&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color:#9c0\"><span style=\"color:#008000\"><span style=\"font-size:36px\">農</span><span style=\"color:#9c0;font-size:36px\">民</span></span></span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/qdKRTDf8Cv\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/790151253144895508?label=&color=2d2d2d&labelColor=dddddd&style=for-the-badge&logo=Discord&\" alt=\"補充包 Discord\"></a> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/mehvahdjukaar\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/endpoint.svg?url=https://shieldsio-patreon.vercel.app/api?username=mehvahdjukaar&type=patrons&style=for-the-badge&label=&color=2d2d2d&labelColor=dddddd&\" alt=\"在 Patreon 支持我\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.twitter.com/Supplementariez\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/twitter/follow/Supplementariez?label=&color=2d2d2d&labelColor=dddddd&style=for-the-badge&logo=Twitter&message=Twitter&\" alt=\"補充包 Twitter\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCOaLLgwzOdbH6rCI7izCptw\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/youtube/channel/subscribers/UCOaLLgwzOdbH6rCI7izCptw?label=&color=2d2d2d&labelColor=dddddd&style=for-the-badge&logo=Youtube&message=Twitter&logoColor=ff0000\" alt=\"補充包 YouTube\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/cCO5btq.png\" width=\"1688\" height=\"42\"></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><strong>📖 關於 📖</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">聰明農民是一個非常簡單的模組，讓農民變得更聰明一點</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>您可以與其他修改農民的模組一起安裝，本模組的邏輯將始終優先。</p>\n<p><strong>請記得開啟生物給予（mob gifting）。否則農民將無法執行任何操作！</strong><br><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\">農民現在可以：</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">與模組作物互動、種植及重新種植</span><br><br></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">根據一定邏輯重新種植作物。他們不再會隨機選擇手邊的第一顆種子，而是會嘗試重新種植剛剛採收的作物</span><br><br></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">若無作物需要重新種植，農民會根據周圍的作物選擇新的種植對象。您的麥田裡再也不會有孤零零的單塊紅蘿蔔了！</span><br><br></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">接受並撿拾這些作物的種子，同時防止非農民角色進行相同行為</span><br><br></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">執行採收任務時會裝備鐮刀。其等級取決於村民的職業等級</span><br><br></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">種植時會裝備即將播種的種子。<br><br></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">不再踩踏耕地</span><br><br></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">能夠以棋盤格模式種植南瓜和西瓜。足夠聰明，不會用其他作物覆蓋現有南瓜作物的空氣方塊。<br><br></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">可以在非原版耕地的方塊上種植與重新種植，透過 \"farmer_plantable_on\" 標籤進行調整。預設包含如補充包的育苗盆等方塊</span><br><br></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">可以採收特殊的非作物類方塊，透過 \"crop_replaceable\" 標籤進行調整。預設包含如沉浸天氣的雜草，以及超重農業和重型作物的巨大作物方塊等</span><br><br></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">對甜漿果叢的傷害具有免疫力</span><br><br></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">任務失敗機率大幅降低，整體操作更流暢敏捷<br><br></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">此外，所有村民現在都會接受並食用您丟給他們的任何（模組）食物，且可進行繁殖<br><br>內建除錯渲染器（Debug Renderers），您可以在設定檔中啟用，以精確查看農民的思考狀態。</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/cCO5btq.png\" width=\"1688\" height=\"42\"></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>❤️支持我❤️</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">開發模組花費了我大量時間，如果您喜歡我的作品並希望支持我，可以在此處進行贊助。贊助後您將獲得專屬於您的客製化地球儀或雕像！若您使用優惠碼 \"supplementaries\" 在 Akliz 購買伺服器，同樣適用此福利。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://ko-fi.com/mehvahdjukaar\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><br><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/sroRu1I.png\" alt=\"Ko-Fi\" width=\"346\" height=\"68\"></a></p>\n<div style=\"text-align:left\">\n<div><span style=\"font-size:18px\">需要伺服器嗎？歡迎瀏覽 Akliz，他們提供專為模組版 Minecraft 打造的高品質伺服器。</span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size:18px\">他們擁有溫馨的社群、卓越的客服支援，伺服器效能也極佳</span><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\">使用優惠碼 \"supplementaries\" 可享 8 折優惠，同時也能支持我！</span></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"text-align:left\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/g5B76A8.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"640\" height=\"150\"></div>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/cCO5btq.png\" width=\"1688\" height=\"42\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>🦉 我們的模組 🦉</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/haunted-harvest\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/769/890/638107786158633425.gif\" alt=\"幽靈收割\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/snowy-spirit\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/488/371/637792657482121666.png\" alt=\"雪之靈\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/labels\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/623/301/638017052310334649.png\" alt=\"儲存標籤\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/goated\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/767/944/638104301571813998.png\" alt=\"Goated\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mystical-oak-tree\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/628/707/638025814904126005.gif\" alt=\"神秘橡木樹\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/carpeted-stairs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/658/179/638058347698730749.png\" alt=\"地毯階梯\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mmmmmmmmmmmm\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/727/100/638080208599452100.png\" alt=\"MmmMmmMmmMmm\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/moyai\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/490/709/637798404029150212.png\" alt=\"摩艾石像\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/just-enough-effect-descriptions-jeed\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/438/886/637685255314420532.png\" alt=\"效果說明\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/better-lily-pads\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/551/229/637888507256267100.png\" alt=\"更好的睡蓮\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/advancement-frames\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/774/798/638115339656250649.png\" alt=\"進度框架\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/randomium-ore\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/774/800/638115342928765853.png\" alt=\"隨機礦石\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a> </span></span></p>",
